<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-, 91-, 364-day T-bill yields fall.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-, 91-, 364-day T-bill yields fall.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 19.85 percent on Tuesday from 21.20 percent at the previous auction on January 28, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills dropped to 25.15 percent from 26.06 percent.</p>
<p>The yield on 364-day T-bills fell to 28.94 percent from 38.04 percent at the previous auction on December 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    Feb 4	    Jan 28</p>
<p> Issue volume		    3.00 million lei   3.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  6.75 million	 11.42 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		     3.00 million	 3.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    19.85 pct	21.20 pct</p>
<p> Price			    98.5 pct	 98.4 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  98.5-98.7 pct  98.4-98.6 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 March 6	  Feb 27</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    Feb 4	    Jan 28</p>
<p> Issue volume		   14.00 million lei  13.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 23.00 million	15.65 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    14.00 million	13.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    25.15 pct	26.06 pct</p>
<p> Price			    94.1 pct	 93.9 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  94.1-96.0 pct  93.9-95.0 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 May 8	    May 1</p>
<p>Full details of the 364-days paper auction:</p>
<p>				    Feb 4	    Dec 18</p>
<p> Issue volume		    3.00 million lei   32.30 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  4.94 million	 32.21 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		     3.00 million	 32.21 million</p>
<p> Yield			    28.94 pct	38.04 pct</p>
<p> Price			    77.6 pct	 72.5 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  77.6-78.7 pct  72.5-72.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Feb 5, 1998    Dec 17</p>
